        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Add a sixth category if your product genuinely needs it. Defend why it does not collapse into one of the five.\n2. Extend the checker so a rule can carry a severity (`block`, `warn`, `info`) and the report aggregates accordingly.\n3. Wire the checker into CI: fail the build if a block-severity rule fails on the latest agent run.\n4. Add an \"expiry\" field per rule. After 90 days without a check fail, the rule is up for review.\n5. Find a real `AGENTS.md` and rewrite it as five-category rules. How many of its lines were operational? How many were aspirational?"
      ]
